{"speciesId":628,"names":{"fr":"Gueriaigle","es":"Braviary","en":"Braviary","ja":"ウォーグル"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Pour les siens, il combat au mépris du danger. Il est capable de soulever une voiture haut dans le ciel."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"They fight for their friends without any thought about danger to themselves. One can carry a car while flying."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Un chevalier du ciel brave et intrépide. Plus son corps porte de cicatrices, plus il est respecté de ses congénères."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"The more scars they have, the more respect these brave soldiers of the sky get from their peers."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"For the sake of its friends, this brave warrior of the sky will not stop battling, even if injured."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"For the sake of its friends, this brave warrior of the sky will not stop battling, even if injured."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Un chevalier du ciel, brave et intrépide. Pour les siens, il combat au mépris du danger, sans jamais fléchir."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Un valiente guerrero del cielo que no duda en luchar por sus compañeros por graves que sean sus heridas."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"For the sake of its friends, this brave warrior of the sky will not stop battling, even if injured."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"仲間の ためなら どれだけ 傷つこうとも 戦いを やめない 勇敢な 大空の 戦士。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Pour les siens, il combat au mépris du danger. Il est capable de soulever une voiture haut dans le ciel."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Lucha por sus compañeros sin reparar en el peligro. Es capaz de volar alto incluso con un coche en sus garras."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"They fight for their friends without any thought about danger to themselves. One can carry a car while flying."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"仲間のため 危険を かえりみず 戦う。自動車を つかんだまま 大空を 舞う ことが できる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Un chevalier du ciel, brave et intrépide. Pour les siens, il combat au mépris du danger, sans jamais fléchir."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Un valiente guerrero del cielo que no duda en luchar por sus compañeros por graves que sean sus heridas."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"For the sake of its friends, this brave warrior of the sky will not stop battling, even if injured."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"仲間の ためなら どれだけ 傷つこうとも 戦いを やめない 勇敢な 大空の 戦士。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Pour les siens, il combat au mépris du danger. Il est capable de soulever une voiture haut dans le ciel."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Lucha por sus compañeros sin reparar en el peligro. Es capaz de volar alto incluso con un coche en sus garras."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"They fight for their friends without any thought about danger to themselves. One can carry a car while flying."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"仲間のため 危険を かえりみず 戦う。自動車を つかんだまま 大空を 舞う ことが できる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Rien n’effraie cet intrépide Pokémon, pas même la mort. Jadis, les gens d’Alola le surnommaient « le preux chevalier du ciel » avec respect."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Por su talante aguerrido, no titubea a la hora de jugarse el pellejo. Los antiguos habitantes de Alola lo veneraban como el Héroe del Cielo."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"With its brave disposition, it fears nothing—not even death. Ancient Alolan people respected it, referring to it as “the hero of the sky.”"},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"死さえ 恐れぬ 勇敢な 気質。 太古の アローラの 人々は 空の勇者と 呼び 尊敬した。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Jadis, l’Homme a menacé son habitat. Tous les Gueriaigle se sont alors rassemblés et ont fait front commun pour repousser la menace."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Cuando los seres humanos amenazaban su hábitat en el pasado, los Braviary se agrupaban para oponer resistencia."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"It’s thought that people disturbed their habitats in the past, so Braviary banded together to fight back."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"棲みかを 人が おびやかした 過去が あり ウォーグルたちは 一丸になって 抗ったという。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Les balafres ne font qu’ajouter à sa renommée, mais les blessures dans le dos, synonymes de fuite en combat, sont mal vues par la volée."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Las cicatrices que surcan su frente demuestran su valor, pero las de su espalda son motivo de mofa por parte de su bandada."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"The more scars it has on its front, the more heroic it’s considered to be. Those with many scars on their back are mocked by the flock."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"向こう傷の 多い ものほど 勇敢とされ 後ろ傷の 多い ものは 群れで バカに される。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Surnommé « le héros céleste », il est tellement fier qu’il préfère endurer mille souffrances plutôt que de choisir la fuite."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Se le conoce como Héroe del Cielo, y su orgullo y valía son tales que prefiere salir herido antes que huir de forma deshonrosa."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Known as “the hero of the skies,” this Pokémon is so proud and so brave that it will never retreat, even when it’s injured."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"空の勇者の 異名を 持つ。 傷ついても 逃げることのない 誇り高く 勇猛な ポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"C’est un Pokémon fier et vaillant. Sa bravoure lui vaut d’être souvent utilisé comme emblème sur les blasons."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Un Pokémon osado y orgulloso, cuyo majestuoso porte lo convierte en un motivo heráldico muy popular."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Known for its bravery and pride, this majestic Pokémon is often seen as a motif for various kinds of emblems."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"勇猛で 誇り高い ポケモン。 その 雄姿を 称え エンブレムの モチーフとして 人気が 高い。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Son caractère agressif et violent lui a valu de perdre son rôle de transporteur à Galar au profit de Corvaillus."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Su carácter agresivo e irascible le ha hecho perder su puesto como transportista en Galar en favor de los Corviknight."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Because this Pokémon is hotheaded and belligerent, it’s Corviknight that’s taken the role of transportation in Galar."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"血の気が 多く 荒っぽいので ガラルの 運び屋の 座は アーマーガアに 奪われた。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"Screaming a bloodcurdling battle cry, this huge and ferocious bird Pokémon goes out on the hunt. It blasts lakes with shock waves, then scoops up any prey that float to the water's surface."}],"varieties":[{"id":628,"moves":[{"name":"cut","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0]]},{"name":"wing-attack","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",10],[14,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",10],[15,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",10],[16,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",10],[17,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",10],[18,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",10],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"whirlwind","learns":[[11,"level-up",57],[14,"level-up",57],[15,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",57],[16,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",57],[17,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",57],[18,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",57],[20,"level-up",42],[25,"level-up",42]]},{"name":"fly","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fury-attack","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",5],[14,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",5],[15,